=== Text #20 ===
> [Nic]Quid Bahama Blizzard will rival any frozen tropical cocktail. Better than sitting on a beach with a breeze in your hair. It is a perfect paring of orange, cranberry and peach which is blended and frozen with cool sweet menthol. NicQuip: The basic recipe for a Daiquirí is also similar to the grog British sailors were rationed aboard ship from the 1740s onwards. You may also have to ration NicQuid Bahama Blizzard before you vape[ it] all up![]


